# Lucide icons: always use DynamicIcon

Never import icon components from `lucide-react`. Always use `DynamicIcon` from `lucide-react/dynamic` with a kebab-case `name`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
import { Globe, ChevronDown } from 'lucide-react'

<Globe className="size-4" />
<ChevronDown />

// ✅ GOOD
import { DynamicIcon } from 'lucide-react/dynamic'

<DynamicIcon name="globe" className="size-4" />
<DynamicIcon name="chevron-down" />
```

Type-only imports from `lucide-react` (`import type { LucideProps }`) are fine when needed for props typing.
